# Healthcare / Pharmacy Analytics – Leadership Decision Brief

## Privacy-Aware Analytical Briefing

### 1. Operational Question

**Which patient and medication patterns are associated with readmission in the supplied synthetic healthcare dataset, and what operational follow-up could be considered while maintaining privacy and avoiding unsupported clinical conclusions?**

