# 10. Leadership Findings
* Finding 1 – Readmission is present in the sample

The overall readmission rate is 30% (3/10 records).

This provides a baseline operational measure for the supplied dataset.

* Finding 2 – Heart disease records show a notable sample-level pattern

Both heart disease records were marked as readmitted.

Because there are only two heart disease records, this should be treated as a signal for further investigation rather than a confirmed population pattern.
